Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Code:
- package-root: backslash-safe traversal guard (split on / AND \) — a `\`-key no
  longer bypasses the `..` check on Windows.
- package-root: cache identity now includes an asset-content fingerprint
  (ASSET_FINGERPRINT from the generator) so same-version rebuilds with a changed
  asset set never reuse a stale extraction (supersedes 7f627647).
- package-root: fast-path reuse re-runs the stat-check (assertAllPresent) before
  trusting the sentinel; count assertion replaced by a real per-file exists+non-empty
  stat-check.
- generator: fail CLOSED when a configured ASSET_ROOT is missing (was silent skip);
  drop the non-existent docs/{TOOLCHAIN,VALIDATION}.md entries (copyEssentialDocs
  no-op) so fail-closed holds.
- config-writer: resolve project-local .skills/skills FIRST; packaged fallback is
  lazy + non-throwing (skill lookup no longer triggers/awaits extraction).
- reset: resolve package root AFTER the force guard (unforced reset can't do
  extraction work or fail with an asset error).
- parity-check: try/finally so temp git dirs never leak on failure paths.
- package.json: asset scripts invoke bun, not node.

Docs: rename design.md → plan.md (repo convention 80:1); correct extraction-dir
path (per-user cache), executable mode (0o700), and completeness claim (stat-check).

Regenerated manifest (fingerprint 62a68d64); re-proven in a compiled binary
(per-user+fingerprint cache, nested paths intact). 142 unit+drift+regression green,
eslint clean.

Issue: 9460dda1-2e69-4390-8f57-c62462118407

